Training and Scholarships Portal. Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development. . Steps: - Request service authorization from the Ministry of Civil Service by the government agency representative;
- Signing in to the service through its related link;
- Entering the application data;
- Follow-up and resubmit applications if they are returned by the Ministry.
